WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.132
One test point for every formula.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.165
With numbers, x y minus y x

3
00:00:05.165 --> 00:00:07.192
vanishes. With matrices, it need not.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.969
Each word becomes its own integral, so no two can cancel.

5
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.352
Claimed: one small matrix tuple suffices.

6
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.584
Lean checks only part.
